      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6142bc91c830f70736b61114|full_name}: In the beta, we now enable finger tracking by default for controllers that can estimate poses (like Quest's) when using SteamVR. \n\nGesture toggle will still enable/disable gesture animations on hands, but when they're disabled you'll see SteamVR's finger poses if \"Avatars Use Finger Tracking\" is enabled.\n\nIf you disable \"Avatars Use Finger Tracking,\" do you get the \"gesture locking\" behavior you expect?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
